flowchart LR
    Shopper[Shopper Browser] --> Root[Root Storefront /]
    Shopper --> TenantStore[Tenant Storefront /{tenantSlug}/]
    Merchant[Merchant Browser] --> TenantSignup[Tenant Signup /{tenantSlug}/signup]
    Merchant --> TenantUpload[Tenant Product Upload]

    Root --> UI[react-ui]
    TenantStore --> UI
    TenantSignup --> UI
    TenantUpload --> UI

    UI --> Gateway[api-gateway-microservice]
    Gateway --> TenantResolver[Tenant Slug Resolver]
    TenantResolver --> Products[products-microservice]
    TenantResolver --> Checkout[checkout-microservice]
    TenantResolver --> Login[login-microservice]

    TenantUpload --> CatalogImport[Product Upload Contract]
    CatalogImport --> Products

    Products --> Catalog[(Tenant-owned product catalog)]
    Checkout --> Orders[(Tenant-owned checkout data)]
    Login --> Merchants[(Merchant and shopper identities)]